          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba hivi kuhusu majiranige ayi arioapha urisi atue Iziraeli, “Lola, nindaausa kula tsi yao, nami nindaausa atu a Juda kula kahi yao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na hata bada ya kuausa, nindaaonera mbazi tsona, na kuareha kpwenye tsi yao chila mmwenga kpwenye seemuye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao achidzifundza njira za atu angu na kuapa kpwa kuhadza dzina rangu, na kuamba, ‘Kpwa kpweli dza Mwenyezi Mlungu aishivyo,’ dza arivyodzifundza kuapa kpwa dzina ra Baali, vivyo ndivyoahenda imara kahi ya atu angu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela ichikala taifa rorosi tarindaphundza, phahi ndariusa na kuriangamiza tsetsetse.” Vivyo ndivyo Mwenyezi Mlungu aambavyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
